<Maximum_Number_of_HVAC_Sizing_Simulation_Passes> rdfs:comment "the entire set of SizingPeriod:* objects may be repeated to fine tune size resultsthis input sets a limit on the number of passes that the sizing algorithms can repeate the set" ;
    idf:fieldType <integer> .

