    <Run_Simulation_for_Sizing_Periods> "Yes" ;
    <Run_Simulation_for_Weather_File_Run_Periods> "No" ;
    rdfs:comment "Note that the following 3 fields are related to the Sizing:Zone, Sizing:System, and Sizing:Plant objects. Having these fields set to Yes but no corresponding Sizing object will not cause the sizing to be done. However, having any of these fields set to No, the corresponding Sizing object is ignored. Note also, if you want to do system sizing, you must also do zone sizing in the same run or an error will result." .

